ning.\n\nIt looks like they'll try to make it look like the left shoulder is working, to get sellers in, then break the highs to take all their stops after getting in as many as they can.\n\nMy advice: Treat this as a compression forming, and don't expect the lows to break \n\naye sir.. noted it.. risk free.. wil looking nearest exit....","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#813","p":33,"im":["ba1d8c5c71758ccc17f19889778c95bca649520d"],"m":813},{"id":"gembel_p33_814","t":"SL to BE is the easiest way to get you out of a great trade.\n\nI'd rather take some profit at tg1. Enough to cover your initial stop being hit.\n\nThere's a chance to make over 200 pips from this, so don't let them knock you out","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#814","p":33,"im":[],"m":814},{"id":"gembel_p33_815","t":"Away\n\nIfmyante wrote: SL to BE is the easiest way to get you out of a great trade.\n\nI'd rather take some profit at tg1. Enough to cover your initial stop being hit.\n\nThere's a chance to make over 200 pips from this, so don't let them knock you out\n\naye sir..noted it again thx for the insight IF sir...","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#815","p":33,"im":[],"m":815},{"id":"gembel_p33_816","t":"Away\n\ntimes out... lets see again","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#816","p":33,"im":["2064c3726761dc61d69ad3e37567fedb2767fa4c"],"m":816},{"id":"gembel_p33_817","t":"What skoulder are you guys referring to?\n\nHans","a":"hansma","d":"","n":"#817","p":33,"im":["2274d22a3441f58e953f957f54913a9e67b3b7e3"],"m":817},{"id":"gembel_p33_818","t":"Away\n\nso tired.. just got back from work liquidity happened 2-3 hours after asia+ aussie session.. today was bearish action.. lets wait tomorow.. will watch other pairs instead","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#818","p":33,"im":["78164feb7989e406dc664ce3c16ec0a04c0789d7"],"m":818},{"id":"gembel_p33_819","t":"Away\n\nGU not best one..SL just horrible for this one..","a":"gembel","d":"","n":"#819","p":33,"im":["732d33037a864569b14f5505e4036d5dd8e99395"],"m":819},{"id":"gembel_p33_820","t"